title: "Master Cleaner"
abstract: >-
  Cross-platform (macOS / Windows / Linux) disk cleaner and optimizer with
  first-class cleanup of AI-era residue, caches, logs, build artifacts,
  containers, large files, and duplicates. Ships a CLI and a local dashboard.
